        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The fleet of SNAM is for one half very recent (2 boats went in service 1997 and 1998). All tankers are equipped with a turbine to burn boil-off gas, which reduces the leakages of natural gas. Italy imports about 3% of the total transported LNG gas in the world. The losses of natural gas amount to 0.094m3/t LNG transported (0.0696 m3/t in 1999).\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset describes the transport of LNG on a LNG tanker. It includes leakage and the use of evaporated natural gas for the turbine.; Geography: The data stems from the maritime sector of the Snam fleet (Italy) 1998/1999.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
